===Etymology===
{{bor+|en|pt|Bengala}}, from {{der|en|fa-cls|بَنْگَالَه}}, from {{der|en|inc-mbn|বাঙ্গালা}}, said to be from the {{w|Vanga Kingdom}}, of uncertain ultimate origin. ''Vangalam'' has been attested in medieval South India. {{dbt|en|Bangla}}.

